Package: ggDragonMaid
Type: Package
Title: Character Colors and Data from "Miss Kobayashi's Dragon Maid"
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Zhaoshuo", "Liu",
      email = "liuzhaoshuo1997@outlook.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides classic color palettes inspired by the main characters
    of the anime "Miss Kobayashi's Dragon Maid", along with a multilingual
    character dataset (Chinese, Japanese, Romaji) containing names, gender,
    and species. The palettes can be used to customize plots in ggplot2 or
    base R graphics.
